#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:4
msgid "Scan Files"
msgstr "扫描文件"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:6
msgid "The steps to follow to :index:`scan and lookup files <scan files>` are:"
msgstr "要 :index:`扫描和查找文件 <scan files>` 的步骤是："

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:9
msgid "Step 1"
msgstr "步骤 1"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:11
msgid "Add your files using :menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Files...\"` or :menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Folder...\"`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Files...\"` 或 "
":menuselection:`\"Files --> Add Folder...\"` 添加您的文件。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:13
msgid "For ease of use it is recommended to use the internal File Browser to manage file system interactions. This is enabled from :menuselection:`\"View --> File Browser\"`."
msgstr ""
"为了方便使用，建议使用内部文件浏览器来管理文件系统交互。这可以通过 "
":menuselection:`\"View --> File Browser\"` 来启用。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:30
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr "步骤 2"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:32
msgid "Drag the selected directory or files to the \"Unclustered Files\" folder, and wait for Picard to process the files - the names will turn from grey to black."
msgstr ""
"将选定的目录或文件拖到 \"未聚类文件\" 文件夹中，并等待 Picard 处理文件——文件"
"名将从灰色变为黑色。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:49
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr "步骤 3"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:51
msgid "Select the desired files and use :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Scan\"` to scan the files to determine their AcoustID fingerprints and lookup using this information. The album(s) matching the files will show up in the right-hand pane based on a \"best match\" using the Preferred Releases settings in the Metadata options."
msgstr ""
"选择所需的文件并使用 :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Scan\"` 来扫描文件以确定它们"
"的 AcoustID 指纹并使用这些信息进行查找。根据元数据选项中的首选发行品设置，匹"
"配文件的专辑将显示在右侧窗格中。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:53
msgid "A music symbol in front of a track number in the right-hand pane indicates that there has been no file assigned to the track."
msgstr "在右侧窗格中的音轨号前有一个音乐符号，表示该音轨没有分配文件。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_scan.rst:68
msgid "If no album was retrieved, or if the album retrieved was incorrect, you may have to try a different method such as clustering the files or a browser lookup."
msgstr ""
"如果未检索到专辑，或者检索到的专辑不正确，您可能需要尝试其他方法，例如对文件"
"进行聚类或使用浏览器查找。"
